{"4454020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fort Synergy Demo", "steam_appid": 4454020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454020/extras/20492fcd01ef32881137e398d1fae007.avif?t=1786302562\" width=1490 height=628 /></span>Try out this demo version of Fort Synergy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fort Synergy is a game where you have to strategically set up your defenses so you can explore the map or you can just help your towers with defending the fort! But be careful, because the weather can be very unpredictable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the fort's computer to gain strategic insights and survive as long as you can!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use different towers to your advantage!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454020/extras/0f794f5ff45ca613dd1ba2ffa822974d.avif?t=1786302562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454020/extras_big/0f794f5ff45ca613dd1ba2ffa822974d.webp?t=1786302562 width=1560 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether they are used to stun your enemies, teleport you back to base quicker, or do AOE damage</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mind the weather!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some waves it may storm, making thunder hit your towers! Other times a meteor may spawn. Make sure you're aware of your environments and deal with it accordingly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Damage the monsters yourself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454020/extras/c6da6de748984acf4d30bbe39ad672cb.avif?t=1786302562\" width=1304 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you upgrade the Fort or just pick up weapons from the base, everything is possible! But be careful because they may target you too! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future support</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize together with your friends to deal with waves more efficiently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP option to play against each other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More and bigger towers!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454020/extras/20492fcd01ef32881137e398d1fae007.avif?t=1786302562\" width=1490 height=628 /></span>Try out this demo version of Fort Synergy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fort Synergy is a game where you have to strategically set up your defenses so you can explore the map or you can just help your towers with defending the fort! But be careful, because the weather can be very unpredictable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the fort's computer to gain strategic insights and survive as long as you can!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use different towers to your advantage!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454020/extras/0f794f5ff45ca613dd1ba2ffa822974d.avif?t=1786302562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454020/extras_big/0f794f5ff45ca613dd1ba2ffa822974d.webp?t=1786302562 width=1560 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether they are used to stun your enemies, teleport you back to base quicker, or do AOE damage</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mind the weather!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some waves it may storm, making thunder hit your towers! Other times a meteor may spawn. Make sure you're aware of your environments and deal with it accordingly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Damage the monsters yourself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454020/extras/c6da6de748984acf4d30bbe39ad672cb.avif?t=1786302562\" width=1304 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you upgrade the Fort or just pick up weapons from the base, everything is possible! But be careful because they may target you too! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future support</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize together with your friends to deal with waves more efficiently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP option to play against each other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More and bigger towers!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A funny co-op tower defense game where you and your friends need to work together to defend yourselves against all the incoming waves of monsters! Decide whether to roam the map or stay near the towers!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454020/2363b484bfc9a9514f93e6cb1c186ed99c99db51/header.jpg?t=1786302562", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454020/11d34cefce806e24fc09280953ddcbf78dc31ca2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786302562", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454020/11d34cefce806e24fc09280953ddcbf78dc31ca2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786302562", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p Low/Medium settings, 30–60 FPS target</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16384 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 / RTX 2060 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p High settings, stable 60+ FPS target</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["DeveGames"], "publishers": ["DeveGames"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 27, "description": "Cross-Platform Multiplayer"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4454020/12b5adcd279afb2d932912520243073bac503701/ss_12b5adcd279afb2d932912520243073bac503701.600x338.jpg?t=178630256